ce is one scalar é (U+00E9); the target is e (U+0065) followed by combining acute (U+0301). With unit costs, what is the minimum?","A lab experiment reports minimum cost 0 under this positive-cost scalar policy. Which statement follows?"],"detailsOpen":true,"currentCount":"0 / 6","filename":"edit-distance.json"}}},"sessionId":"1783152CD58BB56CB99D07608ED732AC"}}
